Subject: [EXPERIMENT] Bound original Raptor IR completion-context copying

Opt-in load-time experiment for observed camera-copy scheduling delay.
Keep the existing deferred path outside one at-most-12-KiB copy operation.
Preserve error reporting, reference release and the atomic resubmit path.
Not a production fix or a claim of bounded interrupt latency.

---
